00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:34.320
The Animals' Hidden Talent Competition!

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:37.860
Happy New Year

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:40.850
Happy New Year 

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:45.740
Happy...

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:47.750
New Year.

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:49.870
Happy...

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:50.960
Happy...

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:52.340
New Year.

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:52.340
New...

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:57.300
Please support Polar Bear's 
Café this year, too.

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:01.800
Please support Polar Bear's 
Café this year, too.

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:01.800
Please.... support...

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:05.030
Well, now that we've got 
the greetings over with,

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:06.600
how about we get things 
rolling for the new year?

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:11.060
Polar Bear's Café's New Year's 
Hidden Talent Competition

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:08.560
Polar Bear's Café's

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:11.060
New Year's hidden talent competition!

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:15.030
Well, now...

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:18.760
We will have everyone show off 
their hidden talents

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:19.990
like we do every year.

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:24.170
Don't wake me up from my hibernation 
for something like this.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:25.740
It doesn't hurt someti—

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:28.140
It's <i>all</i> the time!

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:29.960
Really?

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:35.090
Now, now. We should at least
 spend New Year's together.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:37.250
Whatever.

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:39.050
Hurry up and start.

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:42.370
And now, a delightful New Year's appropriate display...

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:46.420
worthy of starting us off...

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:50.750
...me! Is that okay?

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:52.460
I don't think we have any other choice

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:54.920
but to say yes, since it's New Year's.

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:58.610
Penguin

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:06.500
Well, let's start off with 
another slightly idiotic ta—

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:07.580
Mr. Penguin.

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:09.290
Hey.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:11.490
I just started. What is it?

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:15.320
You're always doing your traditional 
comedic storytelling, right?

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:17.310
That wouldn't be a hidden 
talent, would it?

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:20.010
Show us something more hidden.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:24.040
I guess I could show you a hidden one,

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:26.390
but I practiced this quite a bit...

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:29.430
Show us your hidden talent!

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:36.650
Well, I guess I'll show you the one 
I want to keep hidden the most...

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:50.260
We have arrived.

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:56.060
I think you should 
have kept that hidden.

00:03:57.680 --> 00:04:00.260
That's what I was saying!

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:04.870
Polar Bear, could you keep things 
rolling while I lick my wounds?

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:08.220
Sure. So, who's next?

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:13.800
Well, then... I'll go...

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:15.990
You're rather motivated, Mr. Sloth.

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:21.400
Tablecloth pulling...

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:25.360
Here I go...

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:29.290
If I pull the tablecloth quickly...

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:32.090
The glasses...

00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:36.190
will remain in place...

00:04:36.870 --> 00:04:39.510
That's quite a slow explanation...

00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:45.420
There...

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:56.300
Time for a break...

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:59.480
I think this may take a while.

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:04.570
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:09.040
Here we go...

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:19.960
I think everyone was expecting that.

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:22.280
Now we'll have...

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:24.130
someone from who we don't know what to expect...

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:25.790
You're up, Mr. Handa!

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:26.700
Huh?!

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:31.220
Th-Thank you.

00:05:32.420 --> 00:05:35.460
It doesn't seem like anything 
interesting will happen,

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:37.740
but do your best, Mr. Handa.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.690
Thanks.

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:46.110
First, we're going to remove 
the core of the cabbage.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:50.080
And then, if we place a wet 
paper towel in its place...

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:55.950
It'll last a long time.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:58.830
Mr. Handa?

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:00.400
Yes?

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:02.990
That's not a hidden talent.

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:05.000
That's like grandma's pearls of wisdom.

00:06:06.310 --> 00:06:07.510
I'm sorry.

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:11.390
Don't you have anything else?

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:14.410
Something else...

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:17.500
Oh! I know of a way

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:20.350
to keep the leaves from tearing 
when making cabbage rolls!

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:23.880
Let's stray away from 
cabbages, Mr. Handa.

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:27.870
I'm kinda getting that warm, 
fuzzy feeling on the inside.

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:32.660
You're just trying to sound nice 
since it's New Year's, Polar Bear.

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:35.190
I'll give that trick to make 
cabbages last longer a try

00:06:35.190 --> 00:06:36.250
at the café, Mr. Handa.

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:39.290
Thanks.

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:43.100
Let's see what you've got, Panda.

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:43.860
Okay.

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:57.220
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:01.720
Hello.

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:04.700
If you would, please...

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:06.150
Sure.

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:07.690
Well, then...

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:13.580
Now we will begin our helping hands act.

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:15.530
Please watch.

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:22.060
There.

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:30.380
There.

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:35.860
There.

00:07:36.590 --> 00:07:38.390
There.

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:44.650
Huh?

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:47.690
Panda, could you hand me that?

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:53.180
Panda's not doing anything.

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:57.150
Mr. Full-Time Panda 
is doing all the work.

00:07:57.470 --> 00:07:58.620
Indeed.

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:00.690
Ta-da!

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:07.800
Panda looks proud of himself.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:12.460
Mr. Full-Time Panda looks exhausted.

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:17.850
Not bad, Full-Time.

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:22.580
Could you... leave me alone 
until I catch my breath?

00:08:25.890 --> 00:08:29.180
Well, then I think it's my turn.

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:33.460
Please take a look at my domino setup.

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:43.790
Wow!

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:47.080
It took me two weeks 
to prepare for this day.

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:51.580
When did all this happen?

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:54.210
Sort of ordinary, but wow.

00:08:54.210 --> 00:08:55.590
Thank you.

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:58.890
This part right here 
was particularly hard.

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:00.930
Please loo—

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:24.790
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:29.640
Mr. Llama looks rather depressed.

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:32.020
It was amazing...

00:09:32.770 --> 00:09:34.320
though it failed.

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:38.010
Could you leave me alone for a while.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:39.040
Here you go.

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:47.780
Thank you.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:51.520
Hold it right there, Polar Bear!

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:53.630
How long are you going to make me wait?!

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:58.450
I won't lose to you!

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:02.370
Behold, my hidden talent!

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:02.370
Behold, my hidden talent!

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.710
Grizzly                                          Polar Bear

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:17.700
How do you like this?

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:23.180
Once again, very violent, 
yet careful card handling.

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:27.440
And then, in return, Polar Bear is...

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:36.940
Such rough and violent magic!

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.290
Ta-da!

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:41.720
Take this! I'll spin a 
bigger one than usual!

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:42.400
There!

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:43.910
What a battle!

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:47.230
I ain't done yet!

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:49.380
All right. One, two, one, two...

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:51.200
One, two, one, two...

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:53.050
One, two, one, two...

00:10:53.050 --> 00:10:54.160
One, two...

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:58.420
Come on! What do you have next?!

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:01.780
Grizzly...

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:05.680
What?

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:09.000
I think that's enough.

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:13.610
Regardless of who wins, 
let's be good friends this year, too.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.240
Yeah, you're right.

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:25.620
I've got grilled rice cakes, everyone!

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:29.080
They look delicious!

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:33.540
Now, one more time...

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:35.800
Happy...

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:35.800
Happy...

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:38.010
New Year!

00:11:36.110 --> 00:11:40.190
New Year...

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:42.540
You got tired of the match, didn't you?

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:44.350
Does it matter?

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:46.040
True.

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:50.010
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:52.160
New Year's Guest.

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:57.650
Happy New Year

00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:00.280
Notice of New Year's Break:

00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:00.280
I apologize for any inconvenience, 
but the café will be closed 1/2-1/5. 
Please come again. 
Sincerely, Polar Bear

00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:02.780
Huh? Where's Polar Bear?

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:24.170
Looks like everything is closed, still.

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:31.980
Oh, Panda! Happy New Year!

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.700
Oh, no!

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:35.990
Wait, Panda!

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:38.690
Panda

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:46.370
The year's just begun, and I already 
bumped into Rin Rin...

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:52.330
I wonder if Polar Bear's 
Café will open soon...

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:57.150
I think I'll go home 
and laze around now.

00:12:57.150 --> 00:12:59.010
Oh, really?

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:02.450
And what happened next?

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:02.450
I'm home.

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:04.740
Oh, hi, Brother.

00:13:04.740 --> 00:13:07.240
Huh? Mr. Penguin?

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:08.350
Welcome home!

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:09.990
Welcome home.

00:13:09.990 --> 00:13:12.790
Happy New Year, Panda.

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:13.680
Why are you here?

00:13:14.280 --> 00:13:16.020
Well, the café was closed,

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:17.880
so I thought I'd stop by your place

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:20.010
for New Year's greetings and...

00:13:20.010 --> 00:13:22.750
Mr. Penguin said he was 
going to take off quickly,

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:24.280
so I had him make himself at home.

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:26.020
Oh, I see.

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:29.490
Would you like another, Grandpa?

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:31.990
Here you go, Grandpa.

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:33.910
Happy New Year!

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:37.080
You should have another, Mr. Penguin.

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.670
Oh, no. I'll just pour for you.

00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:40.670
Oh, don't be like that.

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:42.190
Oh, all right.

00:13:42.190 --> 00:13:43.840
We have reached a mutual understanding.

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:50.020
Another?

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:52.050
Oh, all right.

00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:53.720
What's mine is yours.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:56.690
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:58.730
Panda

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:01.690
Ma'am, this sashimi is fantastic!

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:06.110
Help yourself, Mei Mei. It's delicious.

00:14:06.590 --> 00:14:09.530
Thank you very much, Mr. Penguin.

00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:11.990
Sorry about that, Mr. Penguin.

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:15.890
Not at all. 
I love other people's houses.

00:14:15.890 --> 00:14:19.420
Make sure you don't let go 
of the one you love, Mei Mei.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.280
So you think so, too?!

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:26.290
There's no use in asking 
Mr. Penguin about love, Mei Mei...

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:28.160
Oh, shut up!

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:30.990
Please tell me more!

00:14:31.480 --> 00:14:34.010
Sure, why not? Ask me anything.

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:37.980
Mr. Penguin, you're really relaxed.

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:42.190
Huh? Yeah. Something about being at

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:44.440
your house is very relaxing.

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:48.810
Really? Please, don't hold back.

00:14:48.810 --> 00:14:51.740
Thank you very much. 
Just one more, then.

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:52.910
There you go.

00:14:53.690 --> 00:14:56.280
Grandpa, your cup is empty.

00:14:56.900 --> 00:14:58.630
Oh, so it is.

00:14:59.100 --> 00:15:02.290
Have another. It's New Year's.

00:15:02.740 --> 00:15:04.550
Thank you.

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:08.030
Huh? Could we get another, Panda?

00:15:08.030 --> 00:15:10.430
Get Mr. Penguin another, Brother!

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:11.080
Huh?

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:12.300
Get him another.

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:16.450
You're not thoughtful like Mr. Penguin.

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.600
Wha...

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:22.560
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:28.110
Bath

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:27.670
Jeez... It feels like it's not my house.

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:35.950
Oh, I got in the bath before you, Panda.

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:39.340
What? You got in the bath?

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:40.800
I did.

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:44.380
Your mom kept asking me to get in.

00:15:45.690 --> 00:15:48.450
Nothing beats a cold 
ice bath in the winter.

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:53.470
Mr. Penguin doesn't like hot water 
and was trying to hold back, so...

00:15:53.990 --> 00:15:56.640
I don't want to get into an ice bath.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:00.350
Let's forcefully ask him to leave.

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:03.340
Oh, it's fine. It's New Year's.

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:05.810
I've finished with the bath.

00:16:06.470 --> 00:16:08.250
Were you able to relax?

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:10.670
Yes, the bath was great.

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:15.110
Then are you going home now?

00:16:15.710 --> 00:16:16.640
Huh?

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:18.490
What are you talking about, Brother?!

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:22.370
Mr. Penguin is not going home!

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:23.520
He's going to drink more!

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:26.550
Grandpa said he was opening an

00:16:26.550 --> 00:16:28.280
extra special bottle, Mr. Penguin.

00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:29.340
Really?

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:32.230
Shucks, he shouldn't have.

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:35.110
You're not going home?

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:36.300
No, he's not.

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:41.350
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:48.600
It's a shame you're a penguin. 
Why not become a panda?

00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:49.740
Yeah!

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:52.480
Maybe I should.

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:54.990
An emperor panda, huh?

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.200
It's plausible.

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:02.510
<i>I don't think so...</i>

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:10.580
Mr. Penguin, it's almost 
time for the last train.

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:13.090
I can walk home, so it's fine.

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:15.710
Oh, okay...

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:19.100
Mr. Penguin, I've prepared your futon.

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:19.100
Wha?!

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:22.790
Oh, it's all right. 
I'll head out soon...

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:25.520
Please stay the night. It's rather late.

00:17:26.280 --> 00:17:28.870
Please play with me tomorrow, 
too, Mr. Penguin.

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:31.700
Really? Are you sure?

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:33.780
Well, then...

00:17:34.850 --> 00:17:36.280
Goodnight.

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:38.560
You're spending the night?

00:17:38.560 --> 00:17:40.690
Yeah, I am.

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:42.620
I'll walk you to your house.

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:45.060
But it's so late, so I'd feel bad.

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:47.960
That's not what I meant...

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:50.090
Go home!

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:53.960
How can you say something 
so mean to Mr. Penguin?!

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:57.050
Rest well, Mr. Penguin.

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:58.990
I will, thanks.

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:26.340
Sorry that we have you helping out.

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:27.370
Not at all.

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:29.400
You took care of me all day yesterday.

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:32.090
Where's the yuzu pepper?

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:34.210
Oh, I know.

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:36.170
Here you go, Grandpa.

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:39.180
Thanks.

00:18:41.670 --> 00:18:44.120
I think you know my 
house better than I do.

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:46.150
Don't mind me.

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:51.700
Maybe you should go home soon.

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:52.810
It's fine.

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:55.190
I called and had them 
stop the newspaper.

00:18:55.890 --> 00:18:58.940
I'm the type that can sleep for days,

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:00.790
even when it's not my own pillow.

00:19:01.730 --> 00:19:03.380
For days?!

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:06.840
I'll clean later, Ma'am.

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:09.520
Thank you for all of your hard work.

00:19:14.570 --> 00:19:16.790
Panda, you're in the way.

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:20.170
So annoying.

00:19:20.560 --> 00:19:24.720
You should learn something 
from Mr. Penguin.

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:29.550
Oh, it's nothing, really.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:44.160
Panda

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:48.290
Man, what a productive day.

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.240
Goodnight, Panda.

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:06.050
Hello?

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:08.240
Polar Bear?

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:09.480
Panda?

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:10.430
What's the matter?

00:20:11.900 --> 00:20:15.230
I have a small request...

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:16.470
Request?

00:20:26.310 --> 00:20:28.560
Wake up, Mr. Penguin.

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:32.310
What is it?

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:34.890
It's already lunch time.

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:37.750
I forgot about tai-chi.

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:40.220
I should go apologize to Grandpa.

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:41.920
More importantly, Mr. Penguin...

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:47.440
I have something to tell you outside.

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:51.770
What? What is it, Panda?

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:55.480
Polar Bear's Café should 
still be closed.

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:57.440
See?

00:20:57.940 --> 00:20:59.910
Huh? It's open.

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:04.720
Welcome.

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:09.210
Huh? I thought you were 
off until the fifth.

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:10.860
Something came up.

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:15.080
Well, whatever. 
Could I get a café mocha?

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:16.150
Yes.

00:21:17.800 --> 00:21:18.880
Here you go.

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:20.750
Here you go, Panda.

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:28.330
Man, it doesn't feel like 
a new year until I've

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:30.140
had a mocha from here.

00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:37.800
What a relief. Thanks, Polar Bear.

00:21:38.870 --> 00:21:39.910
What?

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:43.930
Are you telling me you only 
gave Panda New Year's money?

00:21:43.930 --> 00:21:45.240
Well, something like that.

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:48.030
Thank you, too, Miss Sasako.

00:21:48.690 --> 00:21:50.970
I had nothing to do for New Year's,

00:21:50.970 --> 00:21:53.850
and I thought I'd be able to 
come here and see everyone.

00:21:53.850 --> 00:21:55.250
You're right.

00:21:56.090 --> 00:22:02.240
This is more relaxing. You always
 feel nervous at other people's houses.

00:22:03.010 --> 00:22:07.270
The only place I can truly 
relax is Polar Bear's Café.

00:22:07.270 --> 00:22:10.010
Please take away his mocha, Polar Bear!

00:22:10.490 --> 00:22:11.720
Okay.

00:22:11.230 --> 00:22:13.610
Huh? What are you doing?!

00:22:13.610 --> 00:22:16.050
Hey! Polar Bear!

00:22:17.440 --> 00:22:24.940
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:23:54.950 --> 00:23:56.220
Tatsu

00:23:54.950 --> 00:24:22.230
Next Time

00:23:56.300 --> 00:23:57.930
mi

00:23:57.930 --> 00:24:00.810
Tatsumi

00:23:58.170 --> 00:23:59.750
Mr. Penguin, Mr. Penguin.

00:23:59.750 --> 00:24:00.790
What is it, Panda?

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:04.920
Please be sure to not tell 
me your goals this year.

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:06.860
When you put it that way, 
I want to tell you.

00:24:06.860 --> 00:24:09.290
Then could you give me 
your debit card pin?

00:24:09.290 --> 00:24:10.290
No.

00:24:10.290 --> 00:24:11.830
Please end this, Mr. Penguin.

00:24:11.830 --> 00:24:15.550
Me? You need to learn everyone's 
roles, Miss Sasako.

00:24:15.550 --> 00:24:17.260
Let's end this, Polar Bear.

00:24:17.260 --> 00:24:19.260
Next week's Polar Bear's Café

00:24:19.260 --> 00:24:21.710
we will be a report on 
the best ramen shops.

00:24:19.430 --> 00:24:22.230
The Hammock Sea
Panda Mama's Gardening

00:24:21.710 --> 00:24:22.430
No, we won't.

00:24:22.230 --> 00:24:24.590
Happy New Year

00:24:22.430 --> 00:24:23.940
Enjoy!
